Z||000000||Cooter||06-08-2000||11:22 PM||||I ordered a bunch of stuff for my 88GT's 3.4 conversion several days ago. When I order from Summit, Jeg's or the Fiero Store, I get the stuff within 3 days everytime. My stuff has finally started to arrive and so far I have got:<BR>An A/C clutch, but I ordered a compresser with clutch!<BR>A pilot shaft bushing I did not need, even though it was recomended it is not even close to fitting the crankshaft or transmission.<BR>A Brute Power Clutch for the wrong transmission.<BR>A clutch release bearing that I don't need because the wrong clutch came with one already.<BR>A clutch master cylinder that has the wrong fitting location. (a first generation instead of a second generation)<P>Out of everything I ordered, the only thing they got right was the transmission output shaft seals and the clutch master cylinder rebuild kit for my other 88.||||reg||1
